1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,848
In January 1973, two men at the top of the

2
00:00:03,868 --> 00:00:05,793
CIA were about to retire.

3
00:00:06,263 --> 00:00:07,819
The Director, Richard Helms.

4
00:00:08,159 --> 00:00:10,372
And the chief of the agency's Technical

5
00:00:10,392 --> 00:00:12,376
Services Division, Sidney Gottlieb.

6
00:00:12,946 --> 00:00:15,307
Helms later told Senate investigators.

7
00:00:15,727 --> 00:00:17,974
Gottlieb, he said, came to him and said he

8
00:00:17,994 --> 00:00:20,133
thought it would be a good idea if these

9
00:00:20,153 --> 00:00:21,267
files were destroyed.

10
00:00:21,836 --> 00:00:24,109
The files were the records of a program

11
00:00:24,129 --> 00:00:25,226
code-named MKUltra.

12
00:00:25,696 --> 00:00:28,038
Staff destroyed them on Gottlieb's verbal

13
00:00:28,058 --> 00:00:28,441
orders.

14
00:00:28,781 --> 00:00:31,024
Gottlieb testified he was carrying out an

15
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:33,286
