16
00:00:34,207 --> 00:00:36,388
For four years, it looked as if the paper

17
00:00:36,408 --> 00:00:37,677
trail was gone for good.

18
00:00:38,247 --> 00:00:41,075
Then, in 1977, a CIA employee answering

19
00:00:41,095 --> 00:00:43,996
