135
00:04:57,998 --> 00:04:59,921
Shortly afterward, according to the

136
00:04:59,941 --> 00:05:02,252
report, Olson showed symptoms of paranoia.

137
00:05:02,722 --> 00:05:05,325
With Lashbrook, he went to New York to see

138
00:05:05,345 --> 00:05:07,886
a doctor, whose own LSD research had been

139
00:05:07,906 --> 00:05:09,697
funded indirectly by the CIA.

140
00:05:10,267 --> 00:05:12,972
In the early hours of November 28, 1953,

141
00:05:12,992 --> 00:05:15,560
while in New York for treatment, Frank

142
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:18,421
Olson fell to his death from a tenth-floor

143
00:05:18,441 --> 00:05:20,329
window of the Statler Hotel.

144
00:05:21,349 --> 00:05:23,437
According to the Senate report, the CIA

145
00:05:23,457 --> 00:05:25,545
