147
00:05:26,825 --> 00:05:28,888
But it did not tell them the circumstances

148
00:05:28,908 --> 00:05:29,533
of his death.

149
00:05:30,103 --> 00:05:32,502
Those details became public 22 years

150
00:05:32,522 --> 00:05:35,257
later, in 1975, during the investigations

151
00:05:35,277 --> 00:05:37,743
