152
00:05:37,763 --> 00:05:38,885
Church Committee.

153
00:05:39,455 --> 00:05:42,382
On July 21, 1975, President Gerald Ford

154
00:05:42,402 --> 00:05:44,875
met Olson's widow and their three

155
00:05:44,895 --> 00:05:45,555
children.

156
00:05:46,025 --> 00:05:48,150
According to the White House summary of

157
00:05:48,170 --> 00:05:50,295
