164
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:05,669
His family later came to doubt the

165
00:06:05,689 --> 00:06:06,578
official account.

166
00:06:06,918 --> 00:06:09,406
In 2012, according to the Baltimore Sun,

167
00:06:09,426 --> 00:06:11,977
his sons sued, claiming that their father

168
00:06:11,997 --> 00:06:12,980
