186
00:06:46,149 --> 00:06:47,214
Helms pushed back.

187
00:06:47,554 --> 00:06:50,080
In December 1963, he argued that testing

188
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:52,753
on unwitting people was the only realistic

189
00:06:52,773 --> 00:06:55,108
method of maintaining the capability,

190
00:06:55,128 --> 00:06:57,400
because the operational targets will

191
00:06:57,420 --> 00:06:58,864
certainly be unwitting.

192
00:06:59,434 --> 00:07:01,634
Otherwise, he warned, the program would

193
00:07:01,654 --> 00:07:03,855
only be pro forma, resulting in a false

194
00:07:03,875 --> 00:07:06,019
