197
00:07:11,893 --> 00:07:14,850
By then, the Inspector General had counted

198
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:17,543
144 projects related to the control of

199
00:07:17,563 --> 00:07:18,606
human behavior.

200
00:07:19,076 --> 00:07:22,713
According to the CIA, MKUltra itself ended

201
00:07:22,733 --> 00:07:23,410
in 1964.

202
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:26,085
And even then, he wrote, the files were

203
00:07:26,105 --> 00:07:27,120
notably incomplete.

204
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:30,929
Which brings us back to January 1973.

205
00:07:31,549 --> 00:07:33,665
Helms explained the decision this way.

206
00:07:34,085 --> 00:07:35,892
There had been relationships with

207
00:07:35,912 --> 00:07:36,446
outsiders.

208
00:07:37,028 --> 00:07:39,042
So they got rid of the files, in his

209
00:07:39,062 --> 00:07:41,359
words, so that anybody who assisted us in

210
00:07:41,379 --> 00:07:43,732
