225
00:08:14,082 --> 00:08:15,497
according to the committee.

226
00:08:15,967 --> 00:08:17,208
It went ahead anyway.

227
00:08:18,128 --> 00:08:19,470
Then came the requests.

228
00:08:20,090 --> 00:08:22,017
Several Freedom of Information Act

229
00:08:22,037 --> 00:08:23,219
