230
00:08:23,559 --> 00:08:25,571
One was from a researcher named John

231
00:08:25,591 --> 00:08:25,909
Marks.

232
00:08:26,379 --> 00:08:28,412
Working through them, a CIA employee

233
00:08:28,432 --> 00:08:30,806
searched every file the responsible branch

234
00:08:30,826 --> 00:08:32,858
