235
00:08:33,428 --> 00:08:36,514
Very late in March 1977, he found the

236
00:08:36,534 --> 00:08:37,522
seven boxes.

237
00:08:37,992 --> 00:08:40,488
They had been sent to the Retired Records

238
00:08:40,508 --> 00:08:43,003
Center in 1970 by the branch's Budget and

239
00:08:43,023 --> 00:08:45,212
Fiscal Section, not with the project

240
00:08:45,232 --> 00:08:45,580
files.

241
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,860
Why, the CIA said, is not known.

242
00:08:48,430 --> 00:08:51,244
As a result, in the words of CIA Director

243
00:08:51,264 --> 00:08:53,939
Stansfield Turner, the material escaped

244
00:08:53,959 --> 00:08:56,290
