253
00:09:15,653 --> 00:09:18,081
The files named 185 researchers and

254
00:09:18,101 --> 00:09:20,808
assistants from outside the government.

255
00:09:21,148 --> 00:09:22,587
And 80 institutions.

256
00:09:23,157 --> 00:09:25,454
44 colleges or universities.

257
00:09:25,794 --> 00:09:28,240
15 research foundations, or chemical and

258
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,782
pharmaceutical companies.

259
00:09:30,122 --> 00:09:31,864
12 hospitals or clinics.

260
00:09:32,334 --> 00:09:34,044
And 3 penal institutions.

261
00:09:34,614 --> 00:09:36,660
Most of the people and institutions

262
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,963
involved, Turner said, are not aware of

263
00:09:38,983 --> 00:09:40,084
