273
00:10:00,653 --> 00:10:01,298
or consent.

274
00:10:02,217 --> 00:10:04,242
So, what does this file actually prove?

275
00:10:04,862 --> 00:10:07,414
It proves the CIA ran a program, approved

276
00:10:07,434 --> 00:10:09,797
by its Director, to research drugs and

277
00:10:09,817 --> 00:10:12,242
other ways to influence human behavior.

278
00:10:12,712 --> 00:10:15,026
And that it tested LSD on Americans who

279
00:10:15,046 --> 00:10:15,803
did not know.

280
00:10:16,374 --> 00:10:19,093
